    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Static growth lines are proxies for rates.", "Tube cross-section and torsion can complicate the ideal model.";
